%% Figure 5. Dynamic view SD-3: a verified PwD is hired and the quota updates (FR-08, QAS-4, QAS-7)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor H as Employer HR
  participant W as Web App
  participant G as Tamkeen API: Auth Guard, Access Policy
  participant A as Applications Module
  participant B as Event Bus
  participant Q as Quota Module
  participant C as Consent Module
  participant N as Notifications Module
  participant D as Main Database
  participant E as Brevo Email API
  Note over H,E: Legend: solid arrow = call or event, dashed arrow = reply, alt = branches
  H->>W: Marks applicant as "Hired"
  W->>G: PATCH /v1/applications/{id}/status {status: hired}
  alt HR's companyId differs from the job's companyId
    G-->>W: 403 problem+json (type .../forbidden-tenant), Audit Module logs attempt
  else same company
    G->>A: changeStatus(id, hired)
    A->>D: transaction: update application + outbox events application.status_changed, employee.hired
    A-->>W: 200 OK
    A->>B: publish employee.hired (after commit)
    B->>Q: employee.hired(companyId, uid)
    Q->>C: isVerifiedPwd(uid)
    C-->>Q: true (boolean only, no disability details)
    Q->>D: insert employment, load quota rule version in force
    Q->>D: save quota snapshot (required, current, gap)
    B->>N: application.status_changed
    N->>D: read pending outbox rows
    N->>E: POST /v3/smtp/email (api-key)
    alt Brevo replies 2xx
      N->>D: mark outbox row sent
    else error or timeout
      N->>D: attempts + 1, retry later with backoff (max 8)
    end
  end
